The root cause is now concrete: this container’s PID namespace reports a process PID that is absent from the host-mounted `/proc`, while Lean 4.22 resolves its own executable through `/proc/<getpid()>/exe` rather than `/proc/self/exe`. I’m applying a narrowly scoped read-only compatibility shim for that one `readlink` pattern, then rerunning the unchanged trusted preflight.
